art\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\" style=\"max-width:708px\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background\"><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__foreground\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__content\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading is-style-default\">HELP SOMEONE DREAM AGAIN<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-ce3e6c2d96a7dc5f348362e494d6ef2b\">Encouragement. Connection. Someone who truly believes in you. For women and gender-diverse people facing poverty, homelessness, or violence, these simple things can make all the difference. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-b61b0036fa896c0fbf0bbd10df9aac2e\">With your donation, you provide exactly that. Your gift ensures they have someone in their corner as they regain their footing, rediscover hope, and build lives full of possibility.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-68dd6decc7e86ec5b495a526a63c6d03\"><strong>Change a life by donating today.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n<p><button data-blackbaud-optimized-form-id=\"5e61a3d4-726d-47b0-84f6-1f1cabe4ba76\">Give Hope<\/button><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:34px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull alignfull getwid-section-content-custom-width\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-medium getwid-justify-content-mobile-center getwid-reset-